implementationPlan.description:
Verify once, fresh.
1. Run the DoD command, `node --test scripts/tests/prompt-cache-launcher.test.mjs scripts/tests/agent-runtime.test.mjs scripts/tests/resume-progress.test.mjs`, which must exit 0. Supply its command, exit code and output tail to complete_task.
2. ALSO run, and report in the summary:
- `bash scripts/tests/postflight.sh` (the new intent-* modes plus every existing mode; widen MOE_POSTFLIGHT_TIMEOUT_SEC on a busy box);
- the postflight.ps1 harness when pwsh is available;
- `bash scripts/tests/parity-check.sh`.
3. Mutants, on scratch copies, restored afterwards:
- a best-effort write under strong: intent-strong-unwritable;
- a rescue ref on refusal: intent-strong-unwritable;
- the journal written after update-ref: intent-strong;
- the profile read from an env var the CLI can set instead of the pinned variable: intent-legacy-unwritable must stay green, and a forged-env variant must stay legacy.
